  - small object detection
abstract: >-
  1,467 colour images recorded during routine work on an assembly line at Icam
  site de Strasbourg-Europe, with hand-held smartphones and with the scene camera
  of a head-mounted eye tracker, annotated with 12,868 axis-aligned bounding boxes
  over eleven categories of components, hand-held tools and workstation
  structures. Released with the annotation protocol, a fixed train and validation
  partition, and a trained detector checkpoint. The DOI is the concept DOI and
  resolves to the newest version; this record describes v3, in which incidental
  faces are blurred.
